    "label": "Honors Program",
    "notes": "The core of the program consists of at least one approved undergraduate seminar course from Molecular, Cell, and Developmental Biology 145, 180A, 180B, 191, Biomedical Research 193H, or 194H, and three research courses (12 units minimum) from 198A, 198B, and 198C, culminating in a thesis. Biomedical Research 193H and 194H are not accepted as electives for the major."
